ly to help each other stay clean and share experiences strength and hope if you think you might have a drug problem please call their helpline or come to one of their meetings 827 west cleveland avenue spokane spokane 99205 drug addiction support group drug use disorder support groups', 'newana.org', 0, 0, 'northeast-washington-area-of-narcotics-anonymous-drug-addiction-support-group-spokane-2d44d630');
