ices and possible options required for the client s needs a comprehensive care plan is established to reduce major barriers to health care and mental health access 1214 east sprague avenue spokane spokane 99202 case management medicaid applications case care management medicaid information counseling case care management referrals', 'nuestrasraiceswa.org', 0, 0, 'nuestras-raices-esperanza-case-management-spokane-3a0ed712');
