ly also offers a clothing and diaper bank that operates every 2 weeks 1214 east sprague avenue spokane spokane 99202 food and clothing bank general clothing provision food pantries baby clothing diapers', 'nuestrasraiceswa.org', 0, 0, 'nuestras-raices-esperanza-food-and-clothing-bank-spokane-75f4e24d');
